 ceiling fans throughout. The kitchen shines with painted cabinets and a sleek subway tile backsplash, while the primary suite features a newly updated shower for a spa-like feel.\r\n\r\nStep outside to the ultimate backyard retreat—a sparkling pool, a cozy cabana, and plenty of space for entertaining. A serene koi pond with six koi fish and blooming water lilies adds to the charm. The beautifully landscaped yard is already flourishing with fresh herbs and flower beds, ready for your personal touch.\r\n\r\nPrime Location! This home is just minutes from Stillhouse Hollow Lake, Purser Park & Dog Park, and Dana Peak Park, offering endless outdoor adventures. Enjoy shopping and dining at Market Heights, and benefit from top-rated schools and easy access to Fort Cavazos.\r\n\r\nWhether you love to grill, chill, or explore, this home has it all. Don’t miss out—schedule your showing today!\n\nLicense Number: 525615\n\nLicensed In: Texas", "channel_id": "UCmdryrgNmYM2DtJwQNq9P_w", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmdryrgNmYM2DtJwQNq9P_w", "duration": 284, "view_count": 10, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tt-Jb41ONEk", "categories": ["Travel & Events"], "tags": ["731 Verna Lee Boulevard", "Harker Heights TX homes", "Harker Heights TX real", "NextHome Southern Skies", "agent Asad Shaikh"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {}, "channel": "Asad Shaikh - Texas Realtor", "channel_follower_count": 15, "uploader": "Asad Shaikh - Texas Realtor", "uploader_id": "@asadshaikhtxrealtor", "uploader_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@asadshaikhtxrealtor", "upload_date": "20250330", "timestamp": 1743313956, "availability": "public", "webpage_url_basename": "watch", "webpage_url_domain": "youtube.com", "extractor": "youtube", "extractor_key": "Yout